1
00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:21,950
A strategy you bought, rented or are trying is marked Owned. The details show what you have and when it ends.

2
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,710
Show in ActFX takes you to it, under Purchased.

3
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:31,190
You can run and test it, but its code is not shown.

4
00:00:31,290 --> 00:00:39,190
So the right-click menu has only Run and Test.

5
00:00:39,290 --> 00:00:45,720
Run works like any other strategy: pick the account, timeframe, symbols and inputs.

6
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:50,220
The app checks your licence while it runs, and reminds you three days before a rent or trial ends.

